* text=auto

*.cs text diff=csharp
*.md text
*.json text

# Unity YAML: 줄 끝 고정. 충돌은 담당자와 참조를 합의하거나 원본에서 재생성
*.unity text eol=lf merge=binary linguist-generated whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.prefab text eol=lf merge=binary linguist-generated
*.asset text eol=lf merge=binary linguist-generated whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.meta text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.mat text eol=lf merge=binary
*.anim text eol=lf merge=binary
*.controller text eol=lf merge=binary

# 바이너리
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.psd binary
*.aseprite binary
*.ase binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# 발표 산출물은 줄 단위 병합/개행 변환 제외
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
